<title>USA: DT Industries eyes acquisition.</title>
<headline>DT Industries eyes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD, Mo. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>DT Industries Inc said it is negotiating the potential acquisition of Rochester, N.Y.-based Hansford Manufacturing Corp.</p>
<p>Privately held Hansford designs and manufactures assembly automation systems.</p>
<p>Details were not disclosed.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
